---@field client_id string This connection's client ID, the same one session.attach returns. Present even when no session is attached.
---@field data_tickets? rex.session.bootstrap.result.data_tickets.item[] A data ticket for each visible block in the returned views that matches an entry of the request's data_tickets. Call data.connect for a block that has none.
---@field selected_session? rex.session.bootstrap.result.selected_session The session the server chose and attached. Null if you sent attach_session_ids or there are no sessions.
---@field server_status rex.session.bootstrap.result.server_status The server's status, as server.status returns it.

